   (h: !(<5))   (the complement on the set)                   M1 F/F/H  5  M1t F/F/H  5  M1a F/F/H  5  M2c F/F/H  5  M2r F/F/H  5
   P & !q, q := P & (h: <5)   (the statement's complement)    M1 H/F/H  6  M1t H/F/H  6  M1a H/F/H  6  M2c H/F/H  6  M2r H/F/H  6
   NOT (h?: <5)  (the mark resolves inside)                   M1 F/F/H  5  M1t F/F/H  5  M1a F/F/H  5  M2c H/F/H  6  M2r H/F/H  6
   (h?: !(<5))                                                M1 H/F/H  6  M1t H/F/H  6  M1a H/F/H  6  M2c H/F/H  6  M2r H/F/H  6
   P & !q, q := P & (h?: <5)                                  M1 F/F/H  5  M1t F/F/H  5  M1a F/F/H  5  M2c F/F/H  5  M2r F/F/H  5
   RZ (h looped), 1,110 subjects: holds on: NOT (h: <5) 800, (h: !(<5)) 300, RZ & !q 810; NOT vs set complement differ 500 (smallest '0;0;5'); NOT vs !q differ 10 (smallest '0')

